This Privacy Policy explains what data the Discord bot **[BOT_NAME]** (the "Bot") processes. The Bot is operated by **Jarjarbin Studio** (the "developer", "we"), contact: Discord **jarjarbin_2006**.

We keep data collection to the minimum needed for the Bot to work.

## 1. Data we process

| Data | Why |
